# 规则：非必要路径和后缀名的一律不许加（遵循奥卡姆剃刀原则，禁止用 .gitignore 掩盖垃圾文件）。

# Build trees
/build*/
/out/
/artifacts/
/.vs/
CMakeUserPresets.json

# Compiler and linker outputs
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib

# IDE state
/.vscode/
/.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Test artifacts
/tests/artifacts/

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
